libfranka
---------
server/src/motion_generator.cpp and
server/include/csc376_franky/motion_generator.hpp are a port of the
MotionGenerator in libfranka's examples/examples_common.cpp and
examples/examples_common.h (https://github.com/frankaemika/libfranka).

    Copyright (c) 2017 Franka Emika GmbH
    Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0:
    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Changes from the original: Eigen is replaced by plain arrays, and the generator
is evaluated as a function of time instead of being called as a libfranka
motion generator.

radiang/csc376
--------------
The joint impedance gains, the collision thresholds and the trajectory checks
of the robot server come from the joint trajectory controller in
https://github.com/radiang/csc376, used and adapted here with its author's
permission.

franky_toolbox_bridge
---------------------
csc376_franky/motion_generator.py and csc376_franky/visualizer.py are based on
Patrick Yao's franky_toolbox_bridge (GitHub: Patrick15Yao), which is no longer
online.
